        <mxCell id="rnmbMTN76tFrj7osgSCc-645" value="&lt;div class=&quot;heading-wrapper&quot; data-heading-level=&quot;h3&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; position: relative; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;why-does-my-on-premises-network-connected-to-azure-vpn-gateway-not-receive-the-default-route-advertised-by-the-route-server&quot; class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-inline-start: -1.875rem; padding-inline-start: 1.875rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;Why does my on-premises network connected to Azure VPN gateway not receive the default route advertised by the Route Server?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Although Azure VPN gateway can receive the default route from its BGP peers including the Route Server, it&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/vpn-gateway/vpn-gateway-vpn-faq#what-address-prefixes-will-azure-vpn-gateways-advertise-to-me&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;doesn&#39;t advertise the default route&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to other peers.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Workaround is:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Split 0/0 for BGP over IPSec&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;route 128.0.0.0/1 via 172.16.25.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-tr