          <mxCell style="aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;image;fontSize=35;image=img/lib/azure2/compute/Virtual_Machine.svg;rounded=0;glass=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillStyle=hachure;strokeWidth=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=none;opacity=70;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="xdwYOMf5n0mw4Xo9QNA6-0" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-2795" y="546" width="69" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="626" value="" style="aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;image;fontSize=12;image=img/lib/azure2/networking/ExpressRoute_Circuits.svg;sketch=1;hachureGap=4;jiggle=2;curveFitting=1;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="xdwYOMf5n0mw4Xo9QNA6-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-2418" y="234" width="70" height="64" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rnmbMTN76tFrj7osgSCc-631" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 42px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;VPN GW Flows&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot;&gt;1. Verify that Standalone just VPN by itself works&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot;&gt;2. Co-existence - Advertize More specific Prefix&amp;nbsp; over VPN to Prefer VPN on the Azure Side&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot;&gt;2. Traffic could get assymetric if on-prem prefers routes learnt over ER circuit&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot;&gt;3. Active-Active Enabled on VPN GW,&lt;/font&gt;VTI-zone in ASAv for firewall stateful behavior over tunnels&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Private IPs Enabled on VPN GW, however, Private IPs disabled on connection&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;VPN over IPsec Tunnel Private Tunnel&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/vpn-gateway/site-to-site-vpn-private-peering&quot;&gt;Site-to-Site VPN connections over ExpressRoute private peering - Azure VPN Gateway | Microsoft Learn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;USe case:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(76, 76, 81);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt;or customers such as those in financial and health industries, double encryption over both their private WANs and Azure WAN is a key compliance requirement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 12px; color: rgb(76, 76, 81);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;VPN over ExpressRoute private peering allows customers to use IPsec tunnels over their ExpressRoute private peering to satisfy this need.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 12px 0px; color: rgb(76, 76, 81);&quot;&gt;You can configure a Site-to-Site VPN to a virtual network gateway over an ExpressRoute private peering using an RFC 1918 IP address.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; list-style-position: outside; margin-bottom: 14px; margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 0px; padding-left: 17px; color: rgb(76, 76, 81);&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-size: inherit; margin-bottom: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 12px 0px;&quot;&gt;Traffic over private peering is encrypted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-size: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 12px 0px;&quot;&gt;Point-to-site users connecting to a virtual network gateway can use ExpressRoute (via the Site-to-Site tunnel) to access on-premises resources.C&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4c4c51&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4c4c51&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Config Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 42px;&quot;&gt;Will be established as long as you have routing between private VPN Peer IPs, &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Local and Remote network steered&amp;nbsp; via private tunnel using more specific routes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;ARS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot; color=&quot;#ffff00&quot;&gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#33001a&quot;&gt;Use Case&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;Same Prefix length&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;Want to prefer VPN or ER, with same prefix!!!&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;Use Routing Preference to Prefer VPN&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Tested with VPN over Public IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;IPSec over ExR - Caveat 10.10.3.4 still has to be advertized over ExR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Will have instability in the tunnel otherwise. (Don&#39;t have a good way to test this end to end (01/08/2023)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Troubleshooting:&lt;br&gt;1. Make sure Public VPN Tunnel works and tunnel parameters match&lt;br&gt;2. Routing for Private IPs&lt;br&gt;3. Enable Private IPs at VPN GW and connection level&lt;br&gt;4. Verify effective routes&lt;br&gt;5. More specific routes&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;6. Active-Active VPN Gateway (vti-zone feature)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;sketch=1;hachureGap=4;jiggle=2;curveFitting=1;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="xdwYOMf5n0mw4Xo9QNA6-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-3237" y="1547" width="3198" height="2249" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rnmbMTN76tFrj7osgSCc-630" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ER Gateway Flows:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;1. Standalone&amp;nbsp; - verify ER circuit by itself works&lt;br&gt;2. Co-existence - Azure will Prefer ExR learnt route over VPN if the same prefix length. Observer the Spoke1-effective Routes&lt;br&gt;2. Traffic could get assymetric if On-Prem is forcing 0/0 via local firewall where VPN terminates. ICMP can still work&lt;br&gt;TCP will fail" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=40;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontColor=#00994D;sketch=1;hachureGap=4;jiggle=2;curveFitting=1;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="xdwYOMf5n0mw4Xo9QNA6-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4875" y="858" width="2431" height="351" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rnmbMTN76tFrj7osgSCc-690" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Scenario 5: Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Co-Existence Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Subnet requirement:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="xdwYOMf5n0mw4Xo9QNA6-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-2327" y="832" width="559" height="169" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
