        <mxCell id="OFD648k348MDKF1rwl64-5" value="&lt;b style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;Scenario3: With NVA and ARS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Requirement:&amp;nbsp; Dymanically learn remote spokes, use HUT-to-HUB Peering&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;NVA in both region support VXLAN and MTU needs to be changed to 1600.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;NVA Bgp peering over VXLAN interface&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;NVA Advertize default route for NS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;Gateway subnet route table for flow symmetry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;Spokes have UDR for 0/0 via NVA (don&#39;t propagate gateway routes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;Spoke vnet peering &quot;use remote gateway&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;Remote spoke traffic goes over vxlan tunnel interface&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;AVS to HQ, Spokes - No Global Reach goes over the VXLAN tunnel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;Experts commnet:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;NVA Subet level UDRfor specific routes pointing to remote NVA is required because of global reach we are learning all remote spoke prefixes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;Expert: AVS Specific Design : 65517 Community is added with NVA and ARS Combo which prevents region 1 ER GW from learning other region-2 0/0 route&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=53;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontColor=#00994D;labelBorderColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;" parent=