        <mxCell id="dO8Jg7tF8n3pvDGooalE-8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;North-South Traffic&amp;nbsp; (Internet bound, on-prem to Internet, spoke to Internet)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Gateway Subnet UDR for local spokes (ARS will program the spoke routes via peering so to overrite that you need static routes)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.1 via NVA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.2 via NVA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. NVA Subnet route table default via Internet (otherwise will loop to itself&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. NVA Subnet propagate GW subnet routes (10.99 via ER)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. NVA Subnet NSG to alllow 10.99&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. NVA IP forwarding NAT for 0/0 via internet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. TO RDP to Spoke1-vm, bypass home IP via Internet, use 0/0 via NVA and don&#39;t propagate gw routes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 49px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="5k02lAMkI8Eejkgjjpoz-4" vertex="1">
